  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a547ba8c44174934991d4667f0352d9e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  customTutorialText: 'The goal is just in sight!


    Move on to the goal check
    point to complete the level and escape into a new area!


    As you move from
    level to level the difficulty will steadily increase with more enemies, more
    lightning, and the are will flood more quickly!


    Make it through all levels
    and reach the helicopter to escape with your life! Don''t forget to collect ALL
    of the classfied documents for the best possible ending!


    You can also challenge
    yourself to complete each level as fast as possible with the timer in the top
    left of the screen to test your limits and ingenuity!'
  customTutorialImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: df8cd2d39990ff441bebccde714ae6c4, type: 3}
