--- !u!114 &1259148317
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1259148313}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a547ba8c44174934991d4667f0352d9e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  customTutorialText: 'Looks like you''ll have to move through that battle platform
    if you want to escape!


    Becareful! Battle platforms are always guarded by
    multiple enemies and even have elite enemies that hit significantly harder and
    have much more health than normal enemies!


    Battle platforms always contain
    power up items and some have classified documents! These classified documents
    hold information about what has been going on at this military research base
    and will help you find the truth about where all these monsters and catastrophic
    weather came from!


    If you want the world to believe you after you escape
    then you  better find all the proof you can before escaping!


    ***Each level
    contains one classified document***'
  customTutorialImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a188eccebb87a0940a78753715ecbcc3, type: 3}
