  customTutorialText: 'Just ahead there are a few powerful items that can help you
    on your journey!


    On the left is a power up ability that will increase your
    jump strength, in the middle is a health pack that can restore you to full health
    if you''ve taken damage, and on the right is a powerful weapon with significantly
    limited ammo compared to your basic gun!


    Keep an eye out for these powerful
    assets as you make your escape!'
